{"step_index":90,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T16:48:03Z","input_tokens":87763,"cache_read_tokens":0,"output_tokens":3808,"thinking":"Current design's simplicity might be perceived as unprofessional. Need to elevate the visual presentation significantly. Will explore design patterns suitable for financial management, aiming for a cleaner aesthetic.\n\n\nTo enhance the professional appearance, a refined typographic system using modern, legible fonts will be implemented. A sophisticated color palette with muted tones and subtle effects like frosted glass will be prioritized over bright, saturated colors. Replacing existing icons with crisp, scalable vector graphics is another key consideration.\n\nExecutive dashboards and KPI cards will be designed with refined visual elements and quick action bars. Modern sidebar or top navigation with search functionality will be considered. Data presentation will incorporate flexible grid/table views with features like sorting and avatars.\n\n\nFocus will shift to incorporating a professional receipt/billing report modal, aiming for modern POS or formal invoice aesthetics with interactive polish. Considerations include examining existing files and dependencies to integrate a robust icon solution, initially checking for Lucide Icons or FontAwesome CDN compatibility. Inline SVGs or the Lucide CDN, with fallback options, present the most reliable approach.\n\n\nConsidering a modern fintech theme with a color palette suitable for financial applications and restaurant point-of-sale systems, the design calls for a deep indigo or navy as the primary color, accented by emerald/teal for positive indicators and crimson/rose for pending debts. A subtle warm amber/orange will add a gourmet touch. The dashboard will feature four KPI cards with prominent Quetzales amounts and corresponding visual cues.\n\nNavigation will utilize modern pill-style tabs with badge counters and quick action buttons for common tasks. Client cards will include elegant avatars and a grid/table view toggle for data presentation. The Lucide icon library will be integrated for scalable vector graphics, using the CDN for reliability.\n\n\nA detailed UI breakdown will be performed, focusing on financial management-specific patterns. Each component, including contact badges, progress bars, and action buttons, will be designed for clarity and usability. The billing report will incorporate both POS ticket and formal invoice formats, with direct WhatsApp integration and print optimization. Forms will feature modern input styles with auto-calculation and quick preset options. Custom toast notifications will be implemented for user feedback.\n\nThe `styles.css` file will be examined to integrate the new font imports and custom POS styling. Custom styles will include options for ticket edges, tabular number alignment, and glassmorphism effects. The print stylesheet will be verified to ensure proper rendering.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"/* ==========================================================================\n   ESTILOS PROFESIONALES - SISTEMA DE CONTROL DE CRÉDITOS Y COBRANZA (POS)\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n\n:root {\n  --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n  --primary-navy: #0f172a;\n  --primary-surface: #ffffff;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n  background-color: #f8fafc;\n  color: #1e293b;\n  font-feature-settings: \"cv02\", \"cv03\", \"cv04\", \"cv11\";\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n.font-mono-numbers {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n\n/* Glassmorphism & Micro-elevations */\n.glass-panel {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);\n}\n\n.kpi-card {\n  transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.kpi-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);\n}\n\n.card-hover-pro {\n  transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);\n}\n\n.card-hover-pro:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 14px 28px -10px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.09), 0 6px 12px -4px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);\n}\n\n/* Scrollbar estilizada y discreta */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 6px;\n  height: 6px;\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: #cbd5e1;\n  border-radius: 9999px;\n}\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n/* Ticket POS estilizado */\n.pos-ticket-paper {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  position: relative;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\n}\n\n/* Borde dentado tipo ticket de restaurante */\n.pos-ticket-paper::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -6px;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  height: 6px;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle, transparent, transparent 50%, #ffffff 50%, #ffffff 100%);\n  background-size: 12px 12px;\n}\n\n.pos-ticket-paper::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  bottom: -6px;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  height: 6px;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle, transparent, transparent 50%, #ffffff 50%, #ffffff 100%);\n  background-size: 12px 12px;\n}\n\n/* Animaciones suaves */\n@keyframes slideUpFade {\n  from {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(8px);\n  }\n  to {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n}\n\n.animate-slide-up {\n  animation: slideUpFade 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n/* Badges de estado modernos con puntos de status */\n.status-pill {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.375rem;\n  padding: 0.2rem 0.625rem;\n  border-radius: 9999px;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n.status-dot {\n  width: 0.45rem;\n  height: 0.45rem;\n  border-radius: 9999px;\n}\n\n/* ================= REGLAS DE IMPRESIÓN ================= */\n@media print {\n  header, footer, nav, .no-print, #toast-container, .fixed {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    background-color: #ffffff !important;\n    color: #000000 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    font-size: 12px !important;\n  }\n\n  /* Impresión de Ticket 80mm */\n  body.printing-ticket #print-area {\n    display: block !important;\n    position: static !important;\n    width: 80mm !important;\n    margin: 0 auto !important;\n    padding: 4mm !important;\n  }\n\n  body.printing-ticket .pos-ticket-paper {\n    box-shadow: none !important;\n    border: none !important;\n    max-width: 80mm !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  body.printing-ticket .pos-ticket-paper::before,\n  body.printing-ticket .pos-ticket-paper::after {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  body.printing-ticket main {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  /* Impresión de Reporte General A4 / Carta */\n  body.printing-report main {\n    display: block !important;\n    max-width: 100% !important;\n    padding: 0 !important;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  body.printing-report #tab-content-reportes {\n    display: block !important;\n  }\n\n  body.printing-report .tab-content:not(#tab-content-reportes) {\n    display: none !important;\n  }\n\n  body.printing-report table {\n    width: 100% !important;\n    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1 !important;\n  }\n\n  body.printing-report th,\n  body.printing-report td {\n    padding: 6px 8px !important;\n  }\n}\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\SISTEMAS\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\control-creditos-comida\\styles.css"}}]}
