{"step_index":94,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-29T16:48:53Z","input_tokens":2902,"cache_read_tokens":91647,"output_tokens":27450,"thinking":"An SVG icon helper function, `icon(name, classes)`, could return clean SVG markup for icons. Example: the 'users' icon would render as a specific SVG string. Similarly, the 'user' icon would have its own corresponding SVG markup.\n\n\nA set of SVG icon definitions are available, each representing a distinct visual element. The markup for each icon, like 'users', 'user', 'plus', and several others, is predefined as an SVG string. Using a helper function, an icon's SVG markup can be efficiently retrieved given its name.\n\n\nThe provided SVG markup represents specific icons. Each icon is defined as a string within the available icon set. The task involves mapping icon names to their corresponding SVG markup for use within a helper function.\n\n\nA function to generate avatar initials and corresponding colors based on a predefined palette will enhance customer card presentation. Introducing a view mode toggle between grid and table layouts addresses user preferences for data density and mobile usability. The bill report should be restyled to resemble a professional receipt, improving its overall clarity and perceived quality.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"/**\n * ==========================================================================\n * SISTEMA PROFESIONAL DE GESTIÓN DE CRÉDITOS Y COBRANZA - NEGOCIOS DE COMIDA\n * GourmetLedger POS & Credit System\n * ==========================================================================\n */\n\n// --- DICCIONARIO DE ICONOS SVG EN LÍNEA (100% OFFLINE & ALTA DEFINICIÓN) ---\nconst ICONS = {\n  users: `<svg class=\"w-4 h-4 inline-block\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-